      "text": "And after a Tippett fight and a Flyers power play (CBJ got the instigator), the Flyers lead 3-2 via Denver Barkey. Great pass from Porter Martone. @gablcarroll recently wrote about Barkey's new role in the bumper: https://t.co/kWCflj2mmr",
